*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.gif
*.pdf
*.md
!README.md
!CATALOG_INGESTION.md

# ── Media binaries ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Keep directory structure (.gitkeep files), ignore actual media binaries.
# Uncomment to exclude audio/images from version control:
# media/audio/*.mp3
# media/audio/*.wav
# media/albums/*.webp
# media/albums/*.jpg
# media/albums/*.png
# media/artists/*.webp
